Guarded computation reuse for Linux

Usage: tracejit <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run                 
  analyze             
  explain             
  doctor              
  cache               
  certify             Issue a reuse certificate for a stored execution (structural evidence only)
  verify-certificate  Independently verify a reuse certificate JSON file
  admission-eval      Offline comparison of cost-sensitive admission policies on a held-out matrix
  refine              Offline CEGAR refinement from a counterexample JSON file (never auto-deploys)
  help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
EXIT:0
